            </note>
            <note corresp="#d71-f6" n="6" xml:id="d71-f6-content">
                <p>For the transcript of the President’s press conference on February 4 at 11:20
                    a.m. in the White House, see <hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the
                        Presidents of the United States: Lyndon B. Johnson, 1965</hi>, Book I, pp.
                    131–139.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
